Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:49:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] UPDATE completion prompts to reopen reviewed patch chats
 for follow-up replies

Treat arbitrary replies to the review-completion question as follow-up requests so users can continue a reviewed patch chat without first fitting the response into a strict yes/no answer. The controller clears the pending decision, marks the feature open, and routes the requested fix back through the normal patch/review cycle.
